text.section:
The Board shall adopt regulations for facility standards that prioritize:

The adoption and implementation of policies and procedures that ensure the health and safety of children attending a Center;


Maintenance based upon the size of the facility and the number of children as related to plumbing, heating, lighting, ventilation, and other applicable building conditions;


Sanitary conditions, including the water supply, sewage disposal, food handling, and general hygiene; and


Any operational or transportation concerns specific to children attending a Center.
